    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good morning, Mr. Maxwell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In St. Louis, the capital of East Fireland, a Scottish-owned island off the coast of the United Kingdom of Brazil and La Plata, there have been reported problems with the sewage system. Manholes are exploding and people are reporting &quot;monsters&quot; coming out to attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The incidents are most frequently happening near the Fireland parliament, and we have reason to believe this is a deliberate coup attempt by the UK Government.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to fly over there and investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best of luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the Acts of Union never happened, Operation: Followthrough takes place a year after the events of Operation: Pinkeye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ken Maxwell, a top agent, working for the Scottish Secret Service (SSS). Tasked with investigating, and fixing, an explosive sewage problem, in a remote Scottish-owned island in South America, in this action packed rail shooter, straight from the arcades to PC!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Stunning 3D graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Branching paths to explore the game's environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Several weapons to mow down enemies with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Collect newspaper articles for the latest news in the world of the SSS series!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good morning, Mr. Maxwell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In St. Louis, the capital of East Fireland, a Scottish-owned island off the coast of the United Kingdom of Brazil and La Plata, there have been reported problems with the sewage system. Manholes are exploding and people are reporting &quot;monsters&quot; coming out to attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The incidents are most frequently happening near the Fireland parliament, and we have reason to believe this is a deliberate coup attempt by the UK Government.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to fly over there and investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best of luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the Acts of Union never happened, Operation: Followthrough takes place a year after the events of Operation: Pinkeye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ken Maxwell, a top agent, working for the Scottish Secret Service (SSS). Tasked with investigating, and fixing, an explosive sewage problem, in a remote Scottish-owned island in South America, in this action packed rail shooter, straight from the arcades to PC!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Stunning 3D graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Branching paths to explore the game's environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Several weapons to mow down enemies with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Collect newspaper articles for the latest news in the world of the SSS series!</p></li></ul>",
